---
import iconMarkdown from '../assets/icons/feat-markdown.svg?raw';
import iconUnattended from '../assets/icons/feat-unattended.svg?raw';
import iconSchedules from '../assets/icons/feat-schedules.svg?raw';
import iconRecorded from '../assets/icons/feat-recorded.svg?raw';
import iconCost from '../assets/icons/feat-cost.svg?raw';
import iconChat from '../assets/icons/feat-chat.svg?raw';
---

<section id="features" class="section section--alt" data-track-section="features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Features</p>
      <h2 class="h2">Everything an unattended run needs. Nothing it doesn't.</h2>
    </div>

    <ul class="grid">
      <li class="card panel">
        <span class="card__icon" set:html={iconMarkdown} />
        <h3 class="card__title">Agents are Markdown</h3>
        <p class="card__text">
          A persona you write here, or a link to the agent your repo already keeps in
          <code>.claude/agents</code>. Versioned, diffable, portable.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="card panel">
        <span class="card__icon" set:html={iconUnattended} />
        <h3 class="card__title">Unattended by design</h3>
        <p class="card__text">
          No permission prompts, ever. Each agent carries its own allow-list and extra directories.
          Anything outside it is denied and recorded.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="card panel">
        <span class="card__icon" set:html={iconSchedules} />
        <h3 class="card__title">Schedules that skip, never queue</h3>
        <p class="card__text">
          Plain cron, DST-safe, no dependency. If the agent is busy the tick is marked skipped. No
          catch-up storms when the laptop wakes.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="card panel">
        <span class="card__icon" set:html={iconRecorded} />
        <h3 class="card__title">Every run recorded</h3>
        <p class="card__text">
          Tool calls, denials, turns, tokens, cost, exit reason. One SQLite file and one JSONL log
          per run. Resume any session with one command.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="card panel">
        <span class="card__icon" set:html={iconCost} />
        <h3 class="card__title">Cost you can see</h3>
        <p class="card__text">
          Per run, per agent, per model, last 24 hours. A budget cap per agent. Pin
          <code>haiku</code> while you experiment.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li class="card panel">
        <span class="card__icon" set:html={iconChat} />
        <h3 class="card__title">Chat is the control room</h3>
        <p class="card__text">
          15 MCP tools. Create agents, start runs, set schedules and ask what happened from Claude
          Desktop, Cowork or Claude Code.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .intro {
    max-width: 640px;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 40px 0 0;
  }

  .card {
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .card__icon :global(svg) {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
  }

  .card__title {
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 30px;
  }

  .card__text {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 22.5px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .card__text code {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
